    "prompt": "A flow-field painting: hundreds of curved strokes follow a slowly evolving noise field and never overlap, each stopping when it nears another, in a limited earthy palette, the field repainting gradually. Build it with a demoscener's economy: one core technique done well, lookup tables and fixed-size buffers kept in room.state, nothing allocated inside hot loops, a steady 60fps at 1920x1080, and compact, clearly named code.",
    "look": [
      "painterly",
